```text
Combat Familiarity ↑
Skill Familiarity ↑
Team Coordination ↑
Confidence ↑
Motivation ↑
Relationship ↑
```

---

# 27. NEGATIVE EFFECT

Training tidak selalu menghasilkan efek positif.

Possible effects:

```text
Fatigue ↑
Stress ↑
Minor Injury
Frustration
Emotional Exhaustion
Temporary Performance Reduction
```

Negative effects tidak otomatis mengunci Hero dari Tower.

Jika efek tersebut cukup berat, sistem dapat mengubah status Hero berdasarkan kondisi aktual.

```text
Minor Injury:
Can Still Be Used

Severe Injury:
Unavailable
```

