# 59. CORE DESIGN PHILOSOPHY

> **Every Hero waits in the Lobby and can be called by the Master.**

Hero tidak harus mengikuti Training terlebih dahulu untuk dapat digunakan.

Training Ground berfungsi sebagai:

```text
OPTIONAL PREPARATION
OPTIONAL IMPROVEMENT
OPTIONAL PARTY SYNERGY
```

Lobby berfungsi sebagai:

```text
HERO STORAGE
HERO SELECTION
HERO AVAILABILITY HUB
```

Party berfungsi sebagai:

```text
TEAM COMPOSITION
MISSION ORGANIZATION
```

Tower berfungsi sebagai:

```text
MISSION DESTINATION
```

Alur utama sistem adalah:

```text
LOBBY
   ↓
MASTER CALLS HERO
   ↓
PARTY
   ↓
TOWER
```

Training hanya menjadi jalur tambahan:

```text
LOBBY
   ↓
OPTIONAL TRAINING
   ↓
LOBBY
```

### Final Rule:

# **HERO IN LOBBY → MASTER CALLS HERO → HERO CAN BE USED → ENTER TOWER**

And:

# **TRAINING GROUND IS OPTIONAL AND MUST NEVER BLOCK HERO ACCESS**
